ation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你无言伫立在毁灭之后</span></p><p begin="26.266" end="31.902" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.266" end="26.707">When you</span> <span begin="26.707" end="26.933">were</span> <span begin="26.933" end="27.549">wait</span><span begin="27.549" end="27.851">ing</span> <span begin="27.851" end="28.570">on</span> <span begin="28.570" end="28.855">the</span> <span begin="28.855" end="29.296">edge</span> <span begin="29.296" end="29.801">of</span> <span begin="29.801" end="30.355">the</span> <span begin="30.355" end="30.869">un</span><span begin="30.869" end="31.902">known</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当你徘徊在未知世界的边缘</span></p><p begin="34.149" end="38.478" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.149" end="34.584">With</span> <span begin="34.584" end="34.788">the</span> <span begin="34.788" end="35.467">cat</span><span begin="35.467" end="35.786">a</span><span begin="35.786" end="36.759">clysm</span> <span begin="36.759" end="37.235">rain</span><span begin="37.235" end="37.706">ing</span> <span begin="37.706" end="38.478">down</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">当灾难来临冲毁一切</span></p><p begin="39.010" end="42.620" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="39.010" end="39.445">In</span><span begin="39.445" end="39.846">sides</span> <span begin="39.846" end="40.426">cry</span><span begin="40.426" end="40.862">ing</span> <span begin="40.862" end="41.425">&quot;save</span> <span begin="41.425" end="41.866">me</span> <span begin="41.866" end="42.620">now&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">尖叫回荡在深夜</span></p><p begin="43.027" end="47.961" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.027" end="43.433">You</span> <span begin="43.433" end="43.839">were</span> <span begin="43.839" end="44.623">there</span> <span begin="44.623" end="44.948">im</span><span begin="44.948" end="45.419">pos</span><span begin="45.419" end="45.831">si</span><span begin="45.831" end="46.330">bly</span> <span begin="46.330" end="47.961">alone</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你独自一人与世界并肩</span></p><p begin="49.552" end="57.545" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="49.552" end="49.795">Do</span> <span begin="49.795" end="50.248">you</span> <span begin="50.248" end="51.032">feel</span> <span begin="51.032" end="52.570">cold</span> <span begin="52.570" end="52.826">and</span> <span begin="52.826" end="53.499">lost</span> <span begin="53.499" end="53.737">in</span> <span begin="53.737" end="54.521">des</span><span begin="54.521" end="54.765">per</span><span begin="54.765" end="55.995">a</span><span begin="55.995" end="57.545">tion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你是否有一种无助的感觉</span></p><p begin="57.801" end="1:05.097" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.801" end="58.039">You</span> <span begin="58.039" end="58.515">build</span> <span begin="58.515" end="59.002">up</span> <span begin="59.002" end="1:00.564">hope</span> <span begin="1:00.564" end="1:00.779">but</span> <span begin="1:00.779" end="1:01.452">fail</span><span begin="1:01.452" end="1:01.748">ure&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:01.748" end="1:02.270">all</span> <span begin="1:02.270" end="1:02.781">you&apos;ve</span> <span begin="1:02.781" end="1:05.097">known</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">满怀希望最终灰飞烟灭</span></p><p begin="1:05.550" end="1:13.455" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:05.550" end="1:05.817">Re</span><span begin="1:05.817" end="1:06.328">mem</span><span begin="1:06.328" end="1:06.781">ber</span> <span begin="1:06.781" end="1:08.522">all</span> <span begin="1:08.522" end="1:08.778">the</span> <span begin="1:08.778" end="1:09.521">sad</span><span begin="1:09.521" end="1:09.736">ness</span> <span begin="1:09.736" end="1:10.200">and</span> <span begin="1:10.200" end="1:10.751">frus</span><span begin="1:10.751" end="1:11.953">tra</span><span begin="1:11.953" end="1:13.455">tion</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">将所有痛苦都铭刻在眼前</span></p><p begin="1:13.764" end="1:20.901" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.764" end="1:14.008">And</span> <span begin="1:14.008" end="1:14.478">let</span> <span begin="1:14.478" end="1:15.018">it</span> <span begin="1:15.018" end="1:20.901">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">让它飘远</span></p><p begin="1:21.085" end="1:26.500" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:21.085" end="1:22.147">Let</span> <span begin="1:22.147" end="1:23.151">it</span> <span begin="1:23.151" end="1:26.500">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">随风飘远</span></p><p begin="1:37.867" end="1:44.305" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.867" end="1:38.064">And</span> <span begin="1:38.064" end="1:38.587">in</span> <span begin="1:38.587" end="1:38.836">the</span> <span begin="1:38.836" end="1:39.597">burst</span> <span begin="1:39.597" end="1:39.812">of</span> <span begin="1:39.812" end="1:40.450">light</span> <span begin="1:40.450" end="1:40.827">that</span> <span begin="1:40.827" end="1:41.350">blind</span><span begin="1:41.350" end="1:41.797">ed</span> <span begin="1:41.797" end="1:42.313">e</span><span begin="1:42.313" end="1:42.795">very</span> <span begin="1:42.795" end="1:43.283">an</span><span begin="1:43.283" end="1:44.305">gel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">电光如剑刺杀了诸神的双眼</span></p><p begin="1:45.878" end="1:52.012" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:45.878" end="1:46.116">As</span> <span begin="1:46.116" end="1:46.580">if</span> <span begin="1:46.580" end="1:46.795">the</span> <span begin="1:46.795" end="1:47.602">sky</span> <span begin="1:47.602" end="1:47.817">had</span> <span begin="1:47.817" end="1:48.432">blown</span> <span begin="1:48.432" end="1:48.815">the</span> <span begin="1:48.815" end="1:49.343">heav</span><span begin="1:49.343" end="1:49.835">ens</span> <span begin="1:49.835" end="1:50.317">in</span><span begin="1:50.317" end="1:50.752">to</span